// QS342: the gateway on, and a stand-in for Claude Code, which the guest does not have. The stand-in
// is the command processor echoing what it was given and then waiting at a prompt: what the pane is
// started with is read back off its first line, and what is sent to it lands at that prompt.
{
  "agentGateway": true,
  "claudeCommand": "cmd /k echo claude-stand-in"
}
